"Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Bayern Munich bosses under fire over Jamal Musiala comments</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae252a88974a6fce88d395ff32cfd8195ec8527e1cdf7c8eac423996f8d5d13d</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:06:59Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T11:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-bosses-under-fire-over-jamal-musiala-comments/a-80013187--78383bcfae5b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-bosses-under-fire-over-jamal-musiala-comments/a-80013187?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Officials have publicly questioned whether Musiala will ever fully recover from a debilitating neurological condition and queried the validity of his contract, prompting criticism from fans, media and the FIFPRO union.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Weapons, war and wavering trust: Germans want to see more restraint in foreign policy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e47d1ec9a1a1cf757e7542dcc5882d2d87b0379ab4889883794a98e4be2d507d</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:08:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T05:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/weapons-war-and-wavering-trust-germans-want-to-see-more-restraint-in-foreign-policy/a-80026254--66b3f174435c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/weapons-war-and-wavering-trust-germans-want-to-see-more-restraint-in-foreign-policy/a-80026254?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">According to a study by the Körber Foundation, a growing number of Germans now oppose providing military aid to Ukraine. The majority also believes that Germany should take a neutral position between the US and China.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>'I've lost her forever' — Why German voice actors are refusing to sign Netflix's AI contract</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a516151866247077fdeae5b11478785fcf04d17c193bd7a110c6a28ce5a20aa6</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:06:59Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T10:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/i-ve-lost-her-forever-why-german-voice-actors-are-refusing-to-sign-netflix-s-ai-contract/a-80004381--da3277b6e37b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/i-ve-lost-her-forever-why-german-voice-actors-are-refusing-to-sign-netflix-s-ai-contract/a-80004381?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For decades, Germans have known Hollywood's biggest stars through the same familiar voices. Now an AI clause in Netflix contracts is splitting the industry over whether it protects performers or exposes them.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Budget cuts threaten Germany's fight against antisemitism and racism</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:23f05a909dfe60a300603ecf01fb1538449c0c8fc9a74184afa6cccff0834cb0</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:06:59Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T10:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/budget-cuts-threaten-germany-s-fight-against-antisemitism-and-racism/a-80018644--fcf379d5b1d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/budget-cuts-threaten-germany-s-fight-against-antisemitism-and-racism/a-80018644?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Numerous grassroots initiatives in Germany are facing funding cuts. Affected organizations are sounding the alarm, pointing to growing challenges posed by far-right extremism.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Has the 'Parthenon puzzle' been solved? The long quest to reassemble lost eastern pediment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f6dcac703ee114ca2c514fd6c279d73bdb58614773c4b69b94d89e123100b74</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:06:59Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/has-the-parthenon-puzzle-been-solved-the-long-quest-to-reassemble-lost-eastern-pediment/a-79982098--4f23b2ccbfc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/has-the-parthenon-puzzle-been-solved-the-long-quest-to-reassemble-lost-eastern-pediment/a-79982098?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The depiction of the birth of the goddess Athena above the Parthenon's entrance is considered a masterpiece of ancient art. Now, a German research team has pieced together all the surviving fragments.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Wael Mohya could make German football history at 17</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be802f4fbe22400806003fdff8c383adf8ff7b793e01664687487bfe0ae129a9</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:06:59Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T15:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wael-mohya-could-make-german-football-history-at-17/a-79919787--677b2c671ea6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wael-mohya-could-make-german-football-history-at-17/a-79919787?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At just 17, Gladbach forward Wael Mohya has earned his first Germany call-up. The dual-national talent has chosen the DFB path for now — and could soon make modern national-team history.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
